      "ARR Month 0 to end of study: fingolimod 1.25 mg 0.192, fingolimod 0.5 mg 0.166, IFN/fingolimod 0.271",
      "Free of 3-month disability progression at end of extension: fingolimod 0.5 mg 71.28%, IFN/fingolimod 73.40%",
      "Free of 6-month disability progression at end of extension: fingolimod 0.5 mg 79.76%, IFN/fingolimod 81.61%"
    ],
    "safety_signals": [
